{"unit_id":"HamSamMike__dsh-mod-manager#card-zh","repo":"HamSamMike/dsh-mod-manager","commit":"edb4ee95b25bfdf0d1f7110c733165ad1580cf37","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Mod Manager 是面向 DSH Web profile 的插件管理器，在设置页提供第三方插件状态列表和开关。它通过读取 profile 已安装 bundle 与 Loader 行自动发现可管理插件，也允许配置手动列表和友好名称。用户可查看插件是否安装、是否启用，并切换启用状态；服务端将禁用项写入 profile 的 cordis.patch.yml，由 Harness watcher 热生效，同时保留其他补丁内容。适合在 DSH Web 中集中管理已安装插件的用户；需要目标 profile 已有待管理插件，可选设置 DSH_HOME。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:111-128","lib/index.js:325-377","lib/client.js:67-90","cordis.patch.yml:7-17"]}
{"unit_id":"HamSamMike__dsh-mod-manager#card-en","repo":"HamSamMike/dsh-mod-manager","commit":"edb4ee95b25bfdf0d1f7110c733165ad1580cf37","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH Mod Manager lists plugins in DSH Web settings. It discovers profile bundles or uses configured entries, shows status, and toggles plugins. The host updates the profile patch file while preserving unrelated patches; changes apply live. Plugins must already be installed in the profile.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:111-128","lib/index.js:325-377","lib/client.js:67-90","cordis.patch.yml:7-17"]}
