{"unit_id":"HamSamMike__dsh-mod-manager#feature-1","repo":"HamSamMike/dsh-mod-manager","commit":"edb4ee95b25bfdf0d1f7110c733165ad1580cf37","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Mod Manager 的功能「查看插件状态」：在设置页显示受管理插件名称、ID、安装状态和启用状态。页面加载或刷新时读取主机端列表接口，用户可据此确认当前 profile 中的状态。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:67-90","lib/client.js:130-159"]}
{"unit_id":"HamSamMike__dsh-mod-manager#feature-2","repo":"HamSamMike/dsh-mod-manager","commit":"edb4ee95b25bfdf0d1f7110c733165ad1580cf37","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Mod Manager 的功能「自动发现第三方插件」：默认读取 profile 清单中的 bundle 名称，并匹配 Loader 模块行来生成管理列表；核心 bundle 和自身会排除。也可通过配置关闭自动发现或指定补充条目。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:68-80","lib/index.js:102-128","cordis.patch.yml:10-17"]}
{"unit_id":"HamSamMike__dsh-mod-manager#feature-3","repo":"HamSamMike/dsh-mod-manager","commit":"edb4ee95b25bfdf0d1f7110c733165ad1580cf37","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Mod Manager 的功能「切换启用状态」：在插件列表点击开启或关闭后，主机端更新目标 profile 的补丁文件中的禁用条目，Harness watcher 可热应用变更，无需卸载插件。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:92-127","lib/index.js:347-377","lib/index.js:271-295"]}
{"unit_id":"HamSamMike__dsh-mod-manager#feature-4","repo":"HamSamMike/dsh-mod-manager","commit":"edb4ee95b25bfdf0d1f7110c733165ad1580cf37","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Mod Manager 的功能「保留补丁配置」：切换状态时只重写管理器生成区块和受管理的顶层条目，保留其他 profile 补丁；没有其他补丁时写入合法的空数组。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:271-295"]}
{"unit_id":"HamSamMike__dsh-mod-manager#caveat-1","repo":"HamSamMike/dsh-mod-manager","commit":"edb4ee95b25bfdf0d1f7110c733165ad1580cf37","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Mod Manager 使用前须知：它只管理已进入目标 profile 和 Loader 的插件，不负责安装或卸载；新安装的 bundle 需重启 DSH Web 后才会出现在列表中。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:68-80","lib/index.js:111-128","README.md:18-19"]}
